{"page":43,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:257","surah":2,"ayah":257,"ar_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ وَلِىُّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ يُخْرِجُهُم مِّنَ ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ إِلَى ٱلنُّورِ ۖ وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ أَوْلِيَآؤُهُمُ ٱلطَّـٰغُوتُ يُخْرِجُونَهُم مِّنَ ٱلنُّورِ إِلَى ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ ۗ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلنَّارِ ۖ هُمْ فِيهَا خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God is the ally of those who believe: He brings them out of the depths of darkness and into the light. As for the disbelievers, their allies are false gods who take them from the light into the depths of darkness, they are the inhabitants of the Fire, and there they will remain.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"al-lahu","verse_key":"2:257"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَلِىُّ","en_gloss":"(is the) Protecting Guardian","transliteration":"waliyyu","verse_key":"2:257"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:257"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe[d]","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"2:257"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُخْرِجُهُم","en_gloss":"He brings them out","transliteration":"yukh'rijuhum","verse_key":"2:257"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:257"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"[the] darkness","transliteration":"l-ẓulumāti","verse_key":"2:257"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"towards","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"2:257"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلنُّورِ ۖ","en_gloss":"[the] light","transliteration":"l-nūri","verse_key":"2:257"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"2:257"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve(d)","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"2:257"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآؤُهُمُ","en_gloss":"their guardians","transliteration":"awliyāuhumu","verse_key":"2:257"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلطَّـٰغُوتُ","en_gloss":"(are) the evil ones","transliteration":"l-ṭāghūtu","verse_key":"2:257"},{